==Tocharian B==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|txb|ine-toc-pro|*meim}}, a nominal derivative of {{m|ine-toc-pro|*mei-|t=to measure}}. Possibly linked to {{der|txb|ine-pro||*mod-ye/o-}} or {{m|ine-pro||*mēdye/o-}}, derivatives of {{m|ine-pro|*med-||to measure, give advice, heal}} (whence {{cog|la|meditor}} and {{cog|sga|midithir}}), or alternatively to {{m|ine-pro||*meh₁-ye/o-}} from {{m|ine-pro|*meh₁-||to measure}} (whence {{cog|la|mētior}}). Compare {{cog|xto|mem}}.

